referenceFunction.generalComment:
Composition (% mol.) of the resulting gas is 28.4% H2, 40.6% CO, 23.6% CO2, 5.9% CH4 and 1.5% CnHm (mol.) on a nitrogen and water free basis. Nitrogen content is 47.6%. Density is 1.15 kg/Nm3. Lower heating value of the gas is 5.2 MJ/Nm3. Heat is supplied by syngas combustion. Inventory refers to the net production of 1 Nm3 syngas. Net gas yield is 1.922 Nm3/kg of wood (dry matter).;
Synonyms: syngas, synthesis gas; 
UUID: 74d113a6-54ce-3aec-b0ae-c7d1af34197c
